#   - runs `git ls-files` to get the list of tracked files
#   - defines three byte strings: dec (decomposed e+COMBINING_ACUTE), pre (precomposed e-acute), plain ("Dalen")
#   - scans each file's raw bytes for those byte strings
#   - prints counts and up to 8 filenames per category

